Not affiliated with the Israeli Home Front Command
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Azaka is an independent citizen project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or operated by Pikud HaOref (the Israeli Home Front Command), the Israel Defense
Forces, or any Israeli government body.

Azaka reads a public alert feed published by Pikud HaOref. The alert text, the
area names and the per-area time-to-shelter values originate with Pikud HaOref
and remain theirs. Azaka reformats and renders them; it does not author them.

Azaka carries no service-level guarantee. It can be wrong, late or offline.
It is not a substitute for the physical siren, the official Pikud HaOref
application, or Home Front Command instructions.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party feeds
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Azaka can enrich an alert with secondary, unofficial community feeds. Those feeds
are operated by third parties, carry no SLA, and are named in the README. They are
consumed over the public network and are not redistributed as part of this source.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Map data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Base map tiles and geometry are served by third-party providers under their own
terms. See the attribution rendered in the map control on the running site.
